# Netherlands ACC demo: 18 flights at different stages of flight (climb, cruise, descent),
# all above approach altitudes. Every flight has its full route (ORIG, waypoints, DEST) and
# is started mid-route with DIRECT to its next waypoint.
# EWG9KM and NAX4CE cross at FL360 and are detected as a conflict ~10 s into the sim.

